  "raw_reviews": [
    {
      "reviewbody": "A couple of rare songs from the fillmore. Well played, heartfelt, sounds good to me. Wish there was more.",
      "reviewtitle": "GRATEFILLER",
      "reviewer": "CFD6149",
      "reviewdate": "2007-04-14 22:48:17",
      "createdate": "2007-04-14 22:48:17",
      "stars": "4"
    },
    {
      "reviewbody": "There was no such thing as \"The Fillmore West\".  There was \"The Fillmore\" and \"The Fillmore East\".  It's like referring to \"Old Jersey\".",
      "reviewtitle": "East is east",
      "reviewer": "tonedef",
      "reviewdate": "2008-04-24 16:41:42",
      "createdate": "2008-04-24 16:41:42",
      "stars": "4"
    },
    {
      "reviewbody": "After the carosuel ballroom closed, bill graham bought it and moved the fillmore auditorium there because the neighborhood around the original was getting worse. he renamed it fillmore west since he had already opened the fillmore east!\npeas \ngreg",
      "reviewtitle": "yes there isa fillmore west!",
      "reviewer": "mr.transistor",
      "reviewdate": "2008-08-16 04:43:43",
      "createdate": "2008-08-16 04:43:43",
      "stars": "4"
    },
    {
      "reviewbody": "for those who had wondered if there were a an east and west.  there was and the next night is proof. just a little tid bit.",
      "reviewtitle": "listen to the next nite",
      "reviewer": "jjg4762",
      "reviewdate": "2009-03-28 14:17:15",
      "createdate": "2009-03-28 14:17:15",
      "stars": "3"
    },
    {
      "reviewbody": "AUD tapes from this time period are rare and poor. This is listenable. It has a bit of ambiance too.  \n\nI have never heard that first track before.",
      "reviewtitle": "I want more stuff like this.",
      "reviewer": "moriluk",
      "reviewdate": "2009-05-07 02:27:47",
      "createdate": "2009-05-07 02:27:47",
      "stars": "4"
    },
    {
      "reviewbody": "The Let Me In 83968 is definitely from 70-06-24, from the licks during the instrumental to the guy in the crowd at the beginning. They didn't play Friend of the Devil during that show, so I guess the last two songs are from (an) other show(s).",
      "reviewtitle": "Let Me In",
      "reviewer": "4ristotle",
      "reviewdate": "2010-03-11 02:21:30",
      "createdate": "2010-03-11 02:21:30",
      "stars": "0"
    },
    {
      "reviewbody": "These songs are all actually from Ken Lee's recording of 6/24/70. Nothing circulates from 8/17/70. \n\nHowever, there is a post here discussing the actual setlist for this evening: \nhttp://jgmf.blogspot.com/2010/01/gd-august-17-1970-fillmore-west-san.html",
      "reviewtitle": "fake date",
      "reviewer": "light into ashes",
      "reviewdate": "2010-06-30 03:17:32",
      "createdate": "2010-06-30 03:17:32",
      "stars": "0"
    },
    {
      "reviewbody": "Brief, incomplete, incoherent, inauthentic, and inconsistent...\n\nAnd if you can't love any of those things, you can't love the Grateful Dead.\n\nFor the sake of those looking for professionally good music, I have to rate this a 3.",
      "reviewtitle": "-",
      "reviewer": "njpg",
      "reviewdate": "2016-08-17 00:46:16",
      "createdate": "2016-08-17 00:46:16",
      "stars": "3"
    },
    {
      "reviewbody": "This one has been fabricated from before this archive existed.  Its a real show, but only that piece circulated when it was copied from the Master cassette circa 1976.\n Its from  June 24,1970 Early show Acoustic Set @ Capitol Theatre in Portchester, N.Y. \n This is from the same night as the Famed Dark Star jam.\nthis is from the opening set of that night.",
      "reviewtitle": "Wrong Location  Not Fillmore West",
      "reviewer": "John-Jay",
      "reviewdate": "2017-03-13 05:50:00",
      "createdate": "2017-03-13 05:50:00",
      "stars": "4"
    },
    {
      "reviewbody": "Very first words of the 1970-08-18 show:\n\n> Good evening, and welcome to the Fillmore West.\n\n:D",
      "reviewtitle": "Tell Graham that",
      "reviewer": "whit537",
      "reviewer_itemname": "@whit537",
      "reviewdate": "2018-02-01 12:46:29",
      "createdate": "2018-02-01 12:46:29",
      "stars": "2"
    }
  ],
